s/1835679122040946976\nhttps://x.com/hp__001/status/1834204678294569316\nhttps://x.com/hp__001/status/1824392177038115228\n\nそして、OCの設定はこちらです。\n白髪ロングヘア、青い目、そしておっぱいがデカい狐耳少女です。\n性格はクーデレ、表情変化が少ないの美人系です。\n詳しい外表の設定はgoogle driveに参考してください。\n服装は参考を構いなく、ご自由に相性がいい服装に変更してください。\nでも、もしよければ、扇がほしいです！\nちょっと扇で少し顔を隠すポーズがすきです。\nもちろん扇のデザインもお願いします。\n\n使用用途はスマホの壁紙、そしてSNSの個人アイコンです。\n\n依頼経験が少なく、何か失礼がありましたら申し訳ございません。\nお引き受けいただければ幸いです。よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16dUgNGt5DB6TuTiPcShmzFK8AK8Bx7SR?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hp__001/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3295574, "client_id": 3296240, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/634cf4c5/uploads/origins/165b8cfc-42aa-4736-a245-f61d5df75e3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7469c46c206bdae3ee9927104ce38edb", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/634cf4c5/uploads/origins/165b8cfc-42aa-4736-a245-f61d5df75e3a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9dd4e941c03c821b0c3bf9be0241da96", "src_set": ""}, "body": "FFXIVのWOLの絵をお願いしたいです。\n\n彼女はFFXIVのオリジナルキャラクターで、一人旅をしています。彼女はよく気を許しがちで、ふらふらと旅に出ます。\n\n構図やスタイルは自由に決めてください :)よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1piTeVAnp42vNrd-xXqGAuV8Wm41aQB-k?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hp__001/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3295574, "client_id": 1718517, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/55f63db3/uploads/origins/6be2146c-db3c-4031-9e08-b73668397c4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5572ffdadbe26f73ee3cc4d68e2dfc03", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/55f63db3/uploads/origins/6be2146c-db3c-4031-9e08-b73668397c4d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=81aa5f0d053762b4abc8de56e4a9a37e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I like the art you posted on your Twitter (X) so I was wondering if you could draw me and my friend's vtubers! I added the pose into the drive and I would like if Yomi could be on the left side and Cinna on the right side. If possible, Cinna has flowers in her eyes and Yomi has skulls in his eyes. Thank you!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/191QBnQYcsoy68RjUnXv03lx_oQi0Fv5k?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1363897, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "ささもん🌺低浮上", "screen_name": "eneco300", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1559838403570839552/7TBMv4_s.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/779092801157943296/1698462021/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 144}, {"id": 1806032, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "わたしちゃんさん", "screen_name": "watasi_ch3", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1425076895796797445/KCezURAa.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1017645197402886144/1750865107/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 48}, {"i